{"id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-logic-program-substitution.md","title":"逻辑程序的有限支持同时代入","display":"df-logic-program-substitution — 逻辑程序的有限支持同时代入","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","aliases":["72-df-logic-program-substitution"],"display":"df-logic-program-substitution — 逻辑程序的有限支持同时代入","depends_on":["[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.5, print648/PDF660; explicit finite-tree extension","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"finite recursion and source substitution convention checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"将变量支撑的全部递归从解释移入 Assertion，复用正原子子类"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-logic-program-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-logic-program-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logic-program-substitution — 逻辑程序的有限支持同时代入"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.5, print648/PDF660; explicit finite-tree extension"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"finite recursion and source substitution convention checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"将变量支撑的全部递归从解释移入 Assertion，复用正原子子类"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>语言、项、字面量、goal 与子句取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\">\\(R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\delta:V\\to T\">\\(\\theta,\\delta:V\\to T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta\">\\(\\widehat\\theta\\)</span> 对项、关系字面量、有限序列和子句分别按下式扩张；此处没有量词绑定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}\">\\(\\operatorname{vars}\\)</span> 的正式定义见 Assertion；单项调用语法上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarTerm}\">\\(\\operatorname{VarTerm}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 是恒等代入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)&amp;:=\\{x\\in V:\\theta(x)\\ne x\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma:=\\{\\theta\\in T^V:|\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)|&lt;\\omega\\},\\quad\\varepsilon(x):=x,\\\\\n\\widehat\\theta(x)&amp;:=\\theta(x),\\quad\\widehat\\theta(c):=c,\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})):=f(\\widehat\\theta(t_0),\\ldots,\\widehat\\theta(t_{n-1})),\\\\\n\\widehat\\theta(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=R(\\widehat\\theta(\\vec t)),\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\overline R(\\widehat\\theta(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\widehat\\theta(\\langle Z_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})&amp;:=\\langle\\widehat\\theta(Z_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;n},\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(\\langle A,G\\rangle):=\\langle\\widehat\\theta(A),\\widehat\\theta(G)\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\theta\\star\\delta)(x)&amp;:=\\widehat\\delta(\\theta(x)),\\qquad Z\\theta:=\\widehat\\theta(Z),\\\\\n\\theta\\!\\upharpoonright^{\\!*}W(x)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\theta(x),&amp;x\\in W,\\\\x,&amp;x\\notin W\\end{cases}\\quad(W\\subseteq V).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)&amp;:=\\{x\\in V:\\theta(x)\\ne x\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma:=\\{\\theta\\in T^V:|\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)|&lt;\\omega\\},\\quad\\varepsilon(x):=x,\\\\\n\\widehat\\theta(x)&amp;:=\\theta(x),\\quad\\widehat\\theta(c):=c,\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})):=f(\\widehat\\theta(t_0),\\ldots,\\widehat\\theta(t_{n-1})),\\\\\n\\widehat\\theta(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=R(\\widehat\\theta(\\vec t)),\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\overline R(\\widehat\\theta(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\widehat\\theta(\\langle Z_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})&amp;:=\\langle\\widehat\\theta(Z_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;n},\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(\\langle A,G\\rangle):=\\langle\\widehat\\theta(A),\\widehat\\theta(G)\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\theta\\star\\delta)(x)&amp;:=\\widehat\\delta(\\theta(x)),\\qquad Z\\theta:=\\widehat\\theta(Z),\\\\\n\\theta\\!\\upharpoonright^{\\!*}W(x)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\theta(x),&amp;x\\in W,\\\\x,&amp;x\\notin W\\end{cases}\\quad(W\\subseteq V).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{vars}(t)&amp;:=\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)\\quad(t\\in T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{vars}(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t_i),\\quad\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\operatorname{vars}(R(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\langle Z_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})&amp;:=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{vars}(Z_i),\\quad\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\langle A,G\\rangle):=\\operatorname{vars}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{vars}(G).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{vars}(t)&amp;:=\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)\\quad(t\\in T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{vars}(R(\\vec t))&amp;:=\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t_i),\\quad\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\operatorname{vars}(R(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\langle Z_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n})&amp;:=\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\operatorname{vars}(Z_i),\\quad\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\langle A,G\\rangle):=\\operatorname{vars}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{vars}(G).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>代入先同时替换原树的变量，不继续对刚插入的项应用 θ；复合 θ⋆δ 表示先 θ 后 δ。有限支持使规则与书中有限绑定集对应。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vars}\">\\(\\operatorname{vars}\\)</span> 对单项调用既有 VarTerm，对原子取各项变量的并，对负字面量与其正原子相同，对序列及子句取各分量的并；这些是 Hypothesis 声明的既有有限树变量操作，不涉及自由/绑定混淆。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语言、项、字面量、goal 与子句取 [[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]；$V=\\mathrm{Var}_S$，$T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$。$x\\in V$，$c\\in C$，$f\\in F$，$R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\delta:V\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{vars}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VarTerm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)&:=\\{x\\in V:\\theta(x)\\ne x\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma:=\\{\\theta\\in T^V:|\\operatorname{supp}(\\theta)|<\\omega\\},\\quad\\varepsilon(x):=x,\\\\\n\\widehat\\theta(x)&:=\\theta(x),\\quad\\widehat\\theta(c):=c,\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})):=f(\\widehat\\theta(t_0),\\ldots,\\widehat\\theta(t_{n-1})),\\\\\n\\widehat\\theta(R(\\vec t))&:=R(\\widehat\\theta(\\vec t)),\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\overline R(\\widehat\\theta(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\widehat\\theta(\\langle Z_i\\rangle_{i<n})&:=\\langle\\widehat\\theta(Z_i)\\rangle_{i<n},\\quad\n\\widehat\\theta(\\langle A,G\\rangle):=\\langle\\widehat\\theta(A),\\widehat\\theta(G)\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\theta\\star\\delta)(x)&:=\\widehat\\delta(\\theta(x)),\\qquad Z\\theta:=\\widehat\\theta(Z),\\\\\n\\theta\\!\\upharpoonright^{\\!*}W(x)&:=\\begin{cases}\\theta(x),&x\\in W,\\\\x,&x\\notin W\\end{cases}\\quad(W\\subseteq V).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{vars}(t)&:=\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)\\quad(t\\in T),\\\\\n\\operatorname{vars}(R(\\vec t))&:=\\bigcup_{i<|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t_i),\\quad\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\overline R(\\vec t)):=\\operatorname{vars}(R(\\vec t)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\langle Z_i\\rangle_{i<n})&:=\\bigcup_{i<n}\\operatorname{vars}(Z_i),\\quad\n\\operatorname{vars}(\\langle A,G\\rangle):=\\operatorname{vars}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{vars}(G).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{vars}","display":false}],"bytes":3206,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"2d49b9fae2b96976","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\theta,\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$ 与 $t\\sigma$ 取 [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]，$\\operatorname{Unif},\\operatorname{MGU}$ 取 [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]；合成先施 $\\theta$ 后施 $\\tau$。$\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}$ 以变量编号递增的顺序作全称闭包。$\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)$ 只用于该签名的四值结构。以下 DCA 分支仅在 $C\\cup F$ 有限时定义，枚举及 $k_C,m_F,x,\\vec y_j$ 只用于该分支；在此固定单射 $\\nu:C\\cup F\\hookrightarrow\\omega$；$\\langle c_i\\rangle_{i<k_C}$ 与 $\\langle f_j\\rangle_{j<m_F}$ 分别为按 $\\nu$ 严格递增排列的 $C,F$ 的全枚举。$x,\\vec y_j$ 由下式确定，$k_C=|C|,m_F=|F|$；$\\mathsf{DCA}_\\Sigma$ 的记号省略固定参数 $\\nu$。长度为零的量词前缀不添加量词；$a_F(f_j)=0$ 时 $f_j(\\langle\\rangle)$ 仍为合法零元函数项。"},{"id":"d1d3b024cc821344","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-logic-program-syntax]] 的同一签名 $\\Sigma=\\langle C_0,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$、$\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}=R$、$V=\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 及 $T=\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$；这里 $C_0$ 表示常元符号集，与下方的子句 $C$ 区分。$\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Lit}_\\Sigma$ 采用该语法，$\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{vars}$ 及同时代入采用 [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]；不含等式原子。$A$ 是正原子，$l$ 是文字，$C$ 是有限文字集，$\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$。$\\overline A$ 是带负标签的文字。"},{"id":"00d14ca36dbe54df","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"1d5f212f0e342114","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$ 是正规程序，$\\mathcal G=\\mathsf{Goal}_\\Sigma$。代入取 [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]；$\\mathcal A^+$ 将在下式取既有正关系原子集 $\\mathsf{PosAt}_\\Sigma$；$-A$ 在本文件缩写对应的负字面量。"},{"id":"03ecee8b72b25180","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E\\subseteq T^2$ 有限，$\\theta,\\sigma,\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$；代入扩张与顺序复合取 [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]。$A=R(\\vec t),B=S(\\vec u)$ 为正关系原子，$n=a_R(R)$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-557","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-compositi